#: floppy.cpp:127 floppy.cpp:139
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Linux"
msgid ""
"KFloppy supports three file formats under Linux: MS-DOS, Ext2, and Minix"
msgstr ""
"KFloppy Linux uchun uchta fayl tizimini qoʻllaydi: MS-DOS, Ext2, va Minix"

